WEBVTT

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.600
On that day,

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:41.680
which was one of the most
important days in my life,

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.200
I saw both love and hate

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:50.936
coming from two very different white men

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:57.000
that represented the best
and the worst of white America.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:00.576
So deep was my hurt